  "rationale": "The paper focuses on developing a neural network for tissue segmentation in endoscopic images, which is a part of the perception or decision-making component in surgical robotics. However, it does not describe the use of autonomous or semi-autonomous robotic systems performing physical surgical tasks on tissue, phantoms, or in-vivo models. The study is more about image segmentation algorithms rather than evaluating the performance of autonomous robotic systems in executing surgical actions. Therefore, it does not meet the inclusion criteria for the review.",
